## 3. Core Data Schema

### Board Document

```typescript
interface CanvasBoard {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  viewport: { x: number; y: number; zoom: number }; // zoom clamped [0.15, 3.0]
  cards: Record<string, CanvasCard>;
  connections: Connection[];
  createdAt: number;
  updatedAt: number;
}type CardType = 'image' | 'video' | 'audio' | 'embed-url' | 'note';

interface CanvasCard {
  id: string;
  type: CardType;
  x: number;
  y: number;
  width: number;
  height: number;
  rotation: number; // degrees (0-360)
  zIndex: number;
  
  // Content payloads
  blobId?: string;       // key reference inside IndexedDB blob table
  url?: string;          // remote media URL or embed link
  content?: string;      // HTML / JSON string for rich text notes
  
  // Media playback states
  playbackState?: {
    volume: number;      // 0.0 - 1.0
    isMuted: boolean;
    playbackRate: number; // 0.5x, 1x, 1.5x, 2x
    currentTime: number;
  };
}

interface Connection {
  id: string;
  fromCardId: string;
  fromAnchor: 'top' | 'right' | 'bottom' | 'left';
  toCardId: string;
  toAnchor: 'top' | 'right' | 'bottom' | 'left';
  label?: string;
}Infinite Viewport (Pan & Zoom):

Wheel zoom centered around cursor coordinate with limits (MIN_ZOOM = 0.2, MAX_ZOOM = 2.5).

Pan using Middle Click drag or Spacebar + Left Click drag.

Card Manipulation:

Transform controls: 8-point resize bounding box + 1 top rotation handle.

Click to focus brings card to highest zIndex.

Smart Clipboard (Ctrl+V) & Drag-Drop Handling:

Images from clipboard (clipboardData.items): Read blob, store into IndexedDB, instantiate card with natural aspect ratio.

Paste location: Auto-arranged adjacent to the latest selected card or staggered in current viewport center so cards never stack completely on top of each other.

URL paste: Detect YouTube/Vimeo regex or direct .mp4/.webm extension; transform into player card.

File drag-over canvas: Highlight canvas, intercept file drops (video/*, image/*, audio/*), store blobs in IndexedDB.

Media Players:

Minimal native-style floating controls: Play/Pause, scrubber, volume slider, mute toggle, playback speed pill selector (0.5x, 1x, 1.5x, 2x).

Connectors:

Hover card to expose 4 directional anchor ports.

Click-drag anchor port to another card port to snap a bezier arrow.
